					<description><![CDATA[The local networking group, Ladies Out Lunching &#8211; LOL for short &#8211; will host their July Luncheon at Lost Pizza Company in Benton, Wednesday, August 19th from 12:00 &#8211; 1:00 pm.  Come ready to chat and make some new friends!  Luncheon Details: &#8211; Lunch is Dutch Treat: just order and pay your meal. &#8211; Don&#8217;t [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><a href="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/626591966_10103231325835126_5012950194249457064_n.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-115744 " src="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/626591966_10103231325835126_5012950194249457064_n-e1770389860977.jpg" alt="" width="724" height="416" srcset="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/626591966_10103231325835126_5012950194249457064_n-e1770389860977.jpg 1027w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/626591966_10103231325835126_5012950194249457064_n-e1770389860977-300x172.jpg 300w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/626591966_10103231325835126_5012950194249457064_n-e1770389860977-600x345.jpg 600w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/626591966_10103231325835126_5012950194249457064_n-e1770389860977-150x86.jpg 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 724px) 100vw, 724px" /></a></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">The local networking group, <strong><a href="http://www.facebook.com/groups/ladiesoutlunching/">Ladies Out Lunching</a></strong> &#8211; LOL for short &#8211; will host their July Luncheon at Lost Pizza Company in Benton, <strong>Wednesday, August 19th</strong> from 12:00 &#8211; 1:00 pm. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">Come ready to chat and make some new friends! </span></p>
<div>
<p><strong><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">Luncheon Details:</span></strong></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">&#8211; Lunch is Dutch Treat: just order and pay your meal.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">&#8211; Don&#8217;t forget to bring your business cards and materials!</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">&#8211; Happy Gift: If you would like a minute to share about your business bring a small gift or some business swag to share! We will draw for a recipient and you get a chance to share &#8211; everyone loves a present&#8230; right?</span></p>
<p><strong><span style="font-size: 20px;">NONPROFIT SUPPORT! This month we are collecting nonperishable food items and feminine hygiene products for local food pantries.</span></strong></p>
</div>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">LOL meets the 3rd Wednesday of each month at various restaurants around Saline County.  Learn more about LOL and RSVP to an event by visiting  <strong><a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/ladiesoutlunching/">www.facebook.com/groups/ladiesoutlunching/</a></strong></span></p>
<hr />
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #ff6600; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">Browse MySaline&#8217;s full list of all the events in Saline County at <a style="color: #ff6600;" href="http://www.mysaline.com/events">www.mysaline.com/events</a></span></p>
